      "name": "AL26-028 \u2013 Ongoing Help Desk Voice Phishing Campaign Targeting Canadian Organizations",
      "description": "Purpose An Alert is used to raise awareness of a recently identified cyber threat that may impact cyber information assets, and to provide additional detection and mitigation advice to recipients. Details The Canadian Centre for Cyber Security (Cyber Centre) is aware of an ongoing voice phishing (vishing) campaign targeting Canadian organizations, including organizations in the legal and financial sectors. The tradecraft and infrastructure are consistent with publicly reported operations by a financially motivated threat actor Footnote 1 Footnote 2 .",
